# FLINTHOLD: the demo player starts at the title and, with real button
# presses alone, reads the story, walks the map and clears the first three
# stages: it builds, farms hens by its fire pits, upgrades, sounds the horn
# and throws from its post. The save then holds the four numbers.
seed 3
game flinthold
wait 10
expect state == 0
botuntil done1 >= 1 200000
botuntil state == 2 2000
expect story_seen == 1
botuntil done2 >= 1 200000
botuntil done3 >= 1 200000
expect stat_units >= 3
expect stat_hens >= 1
expect stat_spend >= 30
reload
game flinthold
wait 5
expect done3 >= 1
